      "description": "Interactive tree view of a JSON document. The root is a blue circle, objects are green rectangles, arrays are orange rounded rectangles, and primitive values are small dots colored by data type. Students hover to see each value's path and type, click boxes to expand or collapse them, and paste their own JSON to visualize.",
